OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'Teenage Dirtbags' sponsored
OL,4,Aby US rock band
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unlikely friendship has led to an
OL,7,Feven more unlikely partnership, with US
OL,8,Frock band Wheatus sponsoring a
OL,9,FWorcestershire youth football team.
OL,11,FNunnery Wood U13s Phoenix, based in
OL,12,FWorcester, now wear kits bearing the
OL,13,FTeenage Dirtbag band's logo after coach
OL,14,FGraham approached them for support.
OL,16,FThe connection began when Graham and
OL,17,Fhis son Bertie, both fans of the group,
OL,18,Fmet members of Wheatus at a gig in
OL,19,FGloucester and stayed in touch
OL,20,Fafterwards.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
