OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'Teenage Dirtbags' sponsored
OL,4,Aby US rock band
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought Wheatus' logo would look
OL,7,Famazing on a football shirt," Graham
OL,8,Fsaid, adding: "I cheekily asked if they
OL,9,Ffancied sponsoring the team, and they
OL,10,Fsaid yes."
